{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a2-exam","level":"A2","kind":"exam","title":{"de":"A2-Abschlusstest","bn":"A2 লেভেল টেস্ট"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich komme heute nicht mit dem Auto, ___ mit dem Zug.","options":["aber","oder","sondern"],"answer":2,"explanation":"nicht …, sondern …","id":"a2-exam-q1"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"___ Rock gefällt dir besser, der rote oder der blaue?","answers":["Welcher"],"options":["Welcher","Welche","Welches"],"promptBn":"der Rock → ?","id":"a2-exam-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Früher ___ es in unserem Dorf keine Schule.","options":["hatte","gab","gibt"],"answer":1,"explanation":"es gibt → অতীতে es gab","id":"a2-exam-q3"},{"type":"order","prompt":"যখন আমি তরুণ ছিলাম, আমি পাইলট হতে চেয়েছিলাম।","promptBn":"শব্দগুলো সাজিয়ে বাক্যটি তৈরি করুন","words":["Als","ich","jung","war,","wollte","ich","Pilot","werden"],"accept":[],"extra":["du","wolltet"],"id":"a2-exam-q4"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich ___ gern ein Zimmer für zwei Nächte. (ভদ্রভাবে চাওয়া)","answers":["hätte"],"options":["hätte","habe","wäre"],"promptBn":"hätte gern","id":"a2-exam-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich interessiere mich ___ IT und Elektrotechnik.","options":["über","für","auf"],"answer":1,"explanation":"sich interessieren für","id":"a2-exam-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir gehen am Sonntag ___ den Wald spazieren. (ভেতর দিয়ে)","options":["um","gegen","durch"],"answer":2,"explanation":"durch + Akkusativ","id":"a2-exam-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Die Lampe hängt jetzt über ___ Sofa.","options":["dem","das","den"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Wo? → Dativ","id":"a2-exam-q8"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Ich ___ die Bücher auf den Tisch. (খাড়া করে রাখি)","answers":["stelle"],"options":["stelle","stehe","liege"],"promptBn":"stellen → Wohin?","id":"a2-exam-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er hat ___ Mutter Blumen geschenkt.","options":["seine","seinen","seiner"],"answer":2,"explanation":"Dativ: die Mutter → seiner","id":"a2-exam-q10"},{"type":"gap","prompt":"Die neuen Sch